# Top-level compat alias: `include/` is a symlink to `src/`, kept out of
# version control because the Arduino Library Manager rejects symlinked
# repos (arduino-lint LS005). Build entry points (top-level CMakeLists.txt
# and ci.sh) recreate it on demand; the Arduino build never needs it (it
# compiles src/ directly). See CONTRIBUTING.md.
/include
